&lt;/style&gt;&lt;p&gt;The app database (&lt;code&gt;ombi.db&lt;/code&gt;) was locked, preventing the sync engine from updating request records and completing the api handoffs to Radarr.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>